    "file_name": "XIN_ENG_20061109.0072.tml",
    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061109.0072\n\nKATHMANDU, Nov. 9 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nNepali government endorses SPA-guerillas latest pact\n\n\n\n\nNepali government endorsed Thursday the latest six-point agreement between the Seven Party Alliance (SPA) and guerrillas.\n\nThe meeting of council of ministers was held on Thursday morning approving the pact singed on Wednesday midnight.\n\nPrime Minister Koirala, on the occasion, briefed about the agreement to the ministers and sought their commitments to implement the pact.\n\nMeanwhile, Koirala also informed about the agreement to the parliament on Thursday noon.\n\nIn his speech to the parliament he said that the pact had added extra responsibility to all parties involved and stressed on the need to work united.\n\nHe also warned of conspiracy that the reactionary forces might hatch to destroy the historic pact.\n\nKoirala urged the guerrillas to create fearless environment as earliest as possible.",
